  "label": "QT GUI Push Button",
  "category": null,
  "description": null,
  "documentation": "This block creates a variable push button. Leave the label blank to use the variable id as the label.\n\nA push button selects between two values of similar type. The variable will take on one value or the other depending on whether the button is pressed or released.\n\nThe GUI hint can be used to position the widget within the application. The hint is of the form [tab_id@tab_index]: [row, col, row_span, col_span]. Both the tab specification and the grid position are optional.",
